# PURPOSE: Exclude local-only files from the AI Docker build context.
# WHY THIS EXISTS: Reduce build size, avoid leaking secrets, and speed up Docker cache hits.
# DEVELOPMENT BENEFIT: Smaller context transfers and fewer invalidated layers during iteration.
# PRODUCTION NOTE: Production images should still exclude secrets, logs, and host tooling files.
node_modules
.env
.env.*
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
coverage
dist
tmp
.cache
.DS_Store
